{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417410/extras/740e6b23098d0116bb4b3e055178584c.poster.avif?t=1773225784\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417410/extras/740e6b23098d0116bb4b3e055178584c.webm?t=1773225784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417410/extras/740e6b23098d0116bb4b3e055178584c.mp4?t=1773225784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>A <strong>1-3 co-op puzzle horror game</strong>. Lost in an accursed megastore, work together to find the exit before its lurking horrors trap you forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Storebound will be built around several episodes that form a bigger story.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The game currently includes Episodes 1 to 4, representing an average game time of 3-4 hours, depending on the difficulty you select and on how quickly you solve the puzzles. Additional free episodes will expand the overall playtime as new content is added throughout Early Access.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decode the Megastore Together</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up to escape a store that wants you to shop forever. Teamwork and quick thinking are your only tools for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the mall for items and gather clues, using proximity voice chat to piece together the path to your next destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split up and use walkie-talkies to keep contact. Whether you\u2019re calling out code sequences from across the department or guiding a friend through a maze, solving the megastore\u2019s twisted logic is the only way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417410/extras/4672d73f8a37e113c1398bf155232e73.poster.avif?t=1773225784\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417410/extras/4672d73f8a37e113c1398bf155232e73.webm?t=1773225784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417410/extras/4672d73f8a37e113c1398bf155232e73.mp4?t=1773225784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Avoid After-Hours Assistance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the lights go out, the Store is on the look out for shoppers who need &quot;assistance&quot;. Cut communications to stay silent, or risk getting caught. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide in vents, progress without making noise, use flashlights to fight the darkness but be careful as the batteries are limited. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid the mall's traps and aberrations, they will gnaw at your mind until you can't trust what you see or do. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every error might lead the store's staff straight to you. Find fuses to turn the lights back on, buying your team a few precious minutes of safety.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417410/extras/112cb3e9cd1f528ee54c744a49d6dbd3.poster.avif?t=1773225784\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417410/extras/112cb3e9cd1f528ee54c744a49d6dbd3.webm?t=1773225784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417410/extras/112cb3e9cd1f528ee54c744a49d6dbd3.mp4?t=1773225784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Just remember: in a place built for consumption, the final price is always you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity Voice Chat: Hear the screams of your friends echoing from a different aisle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liminal Store: Experience horror in a shopping complex caught between dream and nightmare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walkie-Talkie: Use long-distance communication, beware of who might be listening.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sanity System: The mall gets into your head. Lose control, and you may turn against your friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive 3D Audio: Enjoy the unnerving noises breaking the silence of this not-so-empty store.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayability: Randomized item and obstacle placement, plus multiple difficulty challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression: Earn experience to unlock new abilities and passives. Upgrade them to aid your survival.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417410/extras/dc5b6a0a492cfe397b2f43c4a635c2e1.poster.avif?t=1773225784\" width=1170 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417410/extras/dc5b6a0a492cfe397b2f43c4a635c2e1.webm?t=1773225784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417410/extras/dc5b6a0a492cfe397b2f43c4a635c2e1.mp4?t=1773225784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First step towards freedom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3417410/ee4e7a5323faf76d1d917486ff909e0e63fe9d3a.jpg"},{"name":"Shoplifting","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3417410/2182437f406f0dceea17767ad521b346ad0a2ee7.jpg"},{"name":"Fear of the dark","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3417410/c74f380d342211adc81297f8f08b2201ec120ad2.jpg"},{"name":"Meticulous shopper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3417410/dde599a02c00312286f62d0406c81f36794f2a6e.jpg"},{"name":"Communicative shopper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3417410/8040789598b71914c881f14f5fab60eafecd9369.jpg"},{"name":"Are we out?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3417410/72b9f37a734e6d0c1b53f291d501f01c00de4a4c.jpg"},{"name":"Making friends","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3417410/d733eb3808aedeeca3857f12e31e0c941210825c.jpg"},{"name":"Wanted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3417410/d2902cfa9f99eaf1fd0ea1b72684dd26a6fbb0dd.jpg"},{"name":"Compulsive reader","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3417410/5ecae50c8c86a0c3d4572e7b19405a9ac8880bb9.jpg"},{"name":"Receipts collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3417410/06642736c777dd798b560ef5b33559737ed5b7b1.jpg"}],"total":25},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3417410?t=1773225784","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417410/0d46fec8a6a8754d4f4bbcb49b890aa2262305c5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773225784","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417410/c93e86b5e82e28dcf826b217f04e65219d2b1c70/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1773225784","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417410/c93e86b5e82e28dcf826b217f04e65219d2b1c70/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1773225784","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Some scenes in the game contain depictions of violence, torture, and gore."},"detailed_description":"<h1>Join the Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417410/extras/1a33c87bd7042d3f8996fac9bbeaea8c.avif?t=1773225784\" width=800 height=214 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417410/extras/740e6b23098d0116bb4b3e055178584c.poster.avif?t=1773225784\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417410/extras/740e6b23098d0116bb4b3e055178584c.webm?t=1773225784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417410/extras/740e6b23098d0116bb4b3e055178584c.mp4?t=1773225784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>A <strong>1-3 co-op puzzle horror game</strong>. Lost in an accursed megastore, work together to find the exit before its lurking horrors trap you forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Storebound will be built around several episodes that form a bigger story.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The game currently includes Episodes 1 to 4, representing an average game time of 3-4 hours, depending on the difficulty you select and on how quickly you solve the puzzles. Additional free episodes will expand the overall playtime as new content is added throughout Early Access.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decode the Megastore Together</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up to escape a store that wants you to shop forever. Teamwork and quick thinking are your only tools for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the mall for items and gather clues, using proximity voice chat to piece together the path to your next destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split up and use walkie-talkies to keep contact. Whether you\u2019re calling out code sequences from across the department or guiding a friend through a maze, solving the megastore\u2019s twisted logic is the only way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417410/extras/4672d73f8a37e113c1398bf155232e73.poster.avif?t=1773225784\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417410/extras/4672d73f8a37e113c1398bf155232e73.webm?t=1773225784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417410/extras/4672d73f8a37e113c1398bf155232e73.mp4?t=1773225784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Avoid After-Hours Assistance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the lights go out, the Store is on the look out for shoppers who need &quot;assistance&quot;. Cut communications to stay silent, or risk getting caught. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide in vents, progress without making noise, use flashlights to fight the darkness but be careful as the batteries are limited. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid the mall's traps and aberrations, they will gnaw at your mind until you can't trust what you see or do. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every error might lead the store's staff straight to you. Find fuses to turn the lights back on, buying your team a few precious minutes of safety.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417410/extras/112cb3e9cd1f528ee54c744a49d6dbd3.poster.avif?t=1773225784\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417410/extras/112cb3e9cd1f528ee54c744a49d6dbd3.webm?t=1773225784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417410/extras/112cb3e9cd1f528ee54c744a49d6dbd3.mp4?t=1773225784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Just remember: in a place built for consumption, the final price is always you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity Voice Chat: Hear the screams of your friends echoing from a different aisle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liminal Store: Experience horror in a shopping complex caught between dream and nightmare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walkie-Talkie: Use long-distance communication, beware of who might be listening.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sanity System: The mall gets into your head. Lose control, and you may turn against your friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive 3D Audio: Enjoy the unnerving noises breaking the silence of this not-so-empty store.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayability: Randomized item and obstacle placement, plus multiple difficulty challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression: Earn experience to unlock new abilities and passives. Upgrade them to aid your survival.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417410/extras/dc5b6a0a492cfe397b2f43c4a635c2e1.poster.avif?t=1773225784\" width=1170 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417410/extras/dc5b6a0a492cfe397b2f43c4a635c2e1.webm?t=1773225784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417410/extras/dc5b6a0a492cfe397b2f43c4a635c2e1.mp4?t=1773225784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Embers"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417410/15368b0a5243fd1016b37e4a4aa29c84239fe6d0/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1773225784","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2026 Embers. All Rights Reserved","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3417410/1847005339/4fc3f9dddf8cb82da6193058807f8e1a2c1bd0d1/1772714191/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772729630","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3417410/1847005339/4fc3f9dddf8cb82da6193058807f8e1a2c1bd0d1/1772714191/dash_h264.mpd?t=1772729630","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.co